Z||000004||ThatRickGuy||02-21-2001||12:48 PM||||The coolant could also be moving too fast. If the coolant doesn't stay in the radiator long enough, it won't cool off and will still be hot when it returns to the engine. Also, have you checked the thermostat? Sounds silly, but I'd rather pay $5 for a new thermostat befor a few hundred on a new waterpump and install.||||reg||1
